&lt;li&gt;1+ years’ fulltime experience in a collection role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in English as a Must-have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in German as a Must-have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to deal with different internal stakeholders and in multinational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
