&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly support the SVP in the definition and execution of the&amp;nbsp; strategic roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and execute on urgent and strategic key projects for the SVP and the broader organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with SVP on Partnership and Customer initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Involved with all strategic initiatives that will support and impact the growth and trajectory of the global VE organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner as a sounding board for the SVP on new ideas and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the SVP in the management of the VE Leadership governance, leading preparation and strategy for meetings, including: offsite cadence, content, action items, and execution follow-up&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the SVP, his direct reports and other key stakeholders on key initiatives, ongoing projects and meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage budget in partnership with FP&amp;amp;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional processes, ensuring alignment to current processes and programs (with support from process owners)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication of key messaging with the organization, Celonis, and external interactions with senior leaders across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Celonis’ strategy and ability to effectively navigate through the organization&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business and commercial acumen and understands Finance as a strategic function in a global scale-up with public company readiness ambitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep project management experience with demonstrated success leading complex projects from inception to completion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior consulting experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to deal with uncertainty, solve complex problems and build scalable processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative and works consistently with abstract ideas or situations across multiple areas of the Finance division&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to quickly learn new things while being comfortable working in a high-growth, constantly changing environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling sensitive and confidential financial material in a public company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively and efficiently with stakeholders throughout the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interacting with the Board and C-Suite with ease and confidence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concise and effective written and verbal communication&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently and delivering results autonomously when needed while also able to inspire collaborative solutions and achieve results through others&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solver, analytical, and organized thinker&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident taking initiative and an aptitude for working well with a wide range of people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Calm under fire” demeanor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take on new challenges, which has led to opportunities for increased scope overtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
