&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Frame Strategic Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Institutional Strategy to Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze the bank’s strategic goals (e.g., Operational Resilience, T+1 Settlement Readiness, Capital Efficiency, Regulatory Compliance) and map them to a long-term vision utilizing the Celonis platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect the &quot;Office of the CFO/COO&quot; Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the roadmap for optimizing end-to-end value chains, specifically targeting &lt;strong&gt;Trade Lifecycle (Front-to-Back)&lt;/strong&gt;, Institutional Client Onboarding (KYC/AML), and Inter-company Reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Board-Level Business Case:&lt;/strong&gt; Construct robust business cases that articulate the financial impact of Process Intelligence on specific banking metrics (e.g., Cost-to-Income Ratios, Intraday Liquidity Management, RWA optimization, and Fails Management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Value Assessments: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage industry benchmarks to quantify the value opportunity and present a multi-year strategic roadmap to C-Level executives (CIO, COO, CFO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize Value (Program Execution Leadership)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Multi-Stream Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the de facto Program Lead for large-scale transformations. You will manage &lt;strong&gt;multiple execution streams simultaneously&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment between siloed divisions (e.g., aligning Equities Ops with Reference Data and Compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the &quot;Digital Twin&quot; Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the executive relationship to deliver on the promise of a digital twin, managing the complexity of interconnected processes rather than isolated use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilize the Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide the client on organization design and the maturation of Centers of Excellence (CoE). You will mobilize global cross-functional teams to ensure seamless delivery across key regions (AMER, EMEA, APAC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve Systemic Challenges:&lt;/strong&gt; Tackle difficult implementation hurdles by defining standards for Straight-Through Processing (STP), Exception Management, and regulatory reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure &amp;amp; Report:&lt;/strong&gt; Derive improvement measures in core business functions, present realized value to senior management, and ensure the program is hitting its strategic milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Practice Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Codify Capital Markets Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn client successes into reusable assets, playbooks, and thought leadership for the broader Capital Markets practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Enable:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior leader for the team, coaching junior members on executive relationship management, complex financial instruments, and high-performance team dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the &quot;Voice of the Customer&quot; to our Product teams, ensuring our development roadmap aligns with the specific security, scale, and data lineage needs of a G-SIB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;Responsible for the end-to-end customer value journey, including landing, expanding, adoption, and renewal. Build a strategic expansion roadmap to embed Celonis as the default business transformation platform across the bank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Institutional Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 15+ years of relevant experience, ideally combining tenure at a top-tier &lt;strong&gt;Investment Bank, Asset Manager, or Custodian&lt;/strong&gt; with Strategy Consulting. You must understand the pressure of the trading floor and the complexity of the back office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Markets Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess granular knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;Capital Markets value chain&lt;/strong&gt;. You speak the language of Global Markets Operations, Controllership, Treasury Services, and Risk &amp;amp; Compliance (e.g., MiFID, Dodd-Frank, CSDR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Context:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the modern banking technology stack (Legacy Mainframe vs. Cloud modernization, Swift, FIX protocol) and how to apply Process Intelligence within that landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading &lt;strong&gt;complex, multi-stream programs&lt;/strong&gt;. You have managed initiatives where multiple projects run in parallel under one strategic umbrella, requiring strict dependency management and cross-functional alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of driving large-scale transformation programs that impacted the P&amp;amp;L through operational efficiency or risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience presenting to and influencing C-Level executives (CIO, COO, CFO, CRO). You can navigate complex, matrixed organizations and use data to persuade senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working with ambiguity and possess an entrepreneurial leadership style that inspires teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Business, Finance, Economics, or related field.&amp;nbsp;MBA strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
