&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Pedigree:&lt;/strong&gt; 12+ years of progressive experience within a Big Four or elite management consulting firm, currently operating at the Director, Managing Director, or Partner level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O&amp;amp;G Vertical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, authoritative knowledge of the Oil &amp;amp; Gas sector (Upstream exploration/production, Midstream logistics, Downstream refining/petrochemicals, or LNG), with a track record of leading multi-million-dollar transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS &amp;amp; Process Intelligence Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong conceptual understanding of Process Mining paradigms. Experience with Celonis is highly advantageous, but a proven ability to leverage enterprise software to reshape business processes is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive understanding of the modern enterprise stack (SAP, Oracle, Maximo) and emerging data/AI paradigms (Azure AI, LLMs). &lt;em&gt;Note: You do not need to write code or SQL queries, but you must possess the technical fluency to direct data scientists, engineers, and solution architects.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
