&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be supporting three of our Technical leaders.&amp;nbsp; You will interface and collaborate with different departments globally and work closely with other members of our highly professional and dynamic Executive Support Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As an Executive Assistant, you will be based in Raleigh and support the day-to-day activities of busy global leaders. Additionally, you will be responsible for your own projects and drive them independently. You are a highly detailed individual with the ability to adapt to fast-paced environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Calendaring, expense report and travel management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and coordinate meetings, including attendee management, material preparation, room set-up and issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in creation and editing of documents and presentations for internal and external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the point of contact between the executives and internal or external colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the organization of internal events (e.g., Global Leadership Meetings, Team Events)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support during Customer or Executive meetings in the Raleigh office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad hoc projects and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10% Travel Potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications &amp;amp; experience you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3 years’ experience as an Executive Assistant supporting an SVP or VP, ideally in a fast-growing IT Company, Consulting Industry or Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a tech-driven environment - ideally previous experience supporting Sales Leaders and Teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally you bring a high interest for Tech topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Microsoft Office and Google Suite skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perfect command in English (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable providing structure within an entrepreneurial and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to manage multiple tasks, high flexibility and experience working under pressure with different time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good ability to prioritize tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable, discrete and service oriented personality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of integrity and business ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visa sponsorship is not offered for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
