&lt;h3&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Frame Value for Prospects and Customers&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end customer value journey, including landing, expansion, adoption, and renewal of accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate customers’ strategic objectives into high-impact Celonis use cases and evangelize Process Intelligence across prospects and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate value opportunities and strategic roadmaps to C-level executives in partnership with sales leadership and Celonis executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as an executive sponsor across the customer portfolio and position Celonis as a strategic business transformation platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Create &amp;amp; Scale Value Across the Portfolio&lt;/h3&gt;
