&lt;li&gt;Build reports in Salesforce to track lead flow and database health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve sync errors between our marketing and sales systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Marketing Database and Automation teams with daily operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
