&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and implement&lt;/strong&gt; hybrid solutions that leverage AI to augment human workflows, ensuring a seamless and efficient user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and manage&lt;/strong&gt; API integrations to automate data ingestion from various marketing platforms (e.g., Hubspot, Monday.com) into custom built AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve&lt;/strong&gt; CRM data quality and integrity by developing tools for automated lead-to-account matching, duplicate record removal, and data enrichment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; with cross-functional teams like Brand and Communications to build AI solutions for content generation (e.g., press releases, social media copy) and real-time market trend analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and optimize&lt;/strong&gt; the business impact of your solutions, ensuring they deliver measurable efficiency gains for our teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactively research and recommend&lt;/strong&gt; new AI tools and technologies to drive future efficiency and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of experience in a development or engineering role, with hands-on experience in building and deploying production-level applications, bots, or automated workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or other scripting languages like Javascript and a strong understanding of its libraries for data manipulation (e.g., Pandas).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI/automation frameworks and platforms such as Langchain, Make, Zapier, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
