&lt;p&gt;The Cloud &amp;amp; AI Partnerships team is central to Celonis’ growth strategy as we aim to build out our Go-To-Market (GTM) with the major Hyperscalers and leading AI companies. Key for that is to effectively enable and activate our partnerships and work together with our field teams to drive joint opportunities, marketing events and sales programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For that role we seek a Senior Manager Cloud &amp;amp; AI Partnerships based in New York or Raleigh to join our team and to manage our global Go-To-Market activities with &lt;strong&gt;Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
