&lt;li&gt;Direct the creation of sales assets and enablement programs. Ensure that regional teams are equipped with the right battle cards, pitch decks, and use cases to independently identify and drive joint opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Regional Execution: Work with regional Sales Leaders and Partner Managers to execute the strategy locally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and orchestrate the relationships with Senior Leadership at both Celonis and Databricks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
