&lt;li&gt;You have a sales mindset and you are Team-oriented &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine the ability to develop a holistic strategy and work on operational day to day tasks to execute that strategy and grow our partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being able to translate and articulate a joint product value proposition to business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 years of relevant work experience in the area of partner management, sales or business development, ideally with Microsoft, AWS or Google Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to excite others and build strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studies in Business Administration / Economics / Information Systems is a preference&lt;/li&gt;
