&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Join our dynamic and collaborative Creative Production team, where we bring stories to life through compelling visual and auditory experiences. As a Senior Producer, you will play a pivotal role in shaping our brand narrative and engaging our audience through high-quality video content. You&#39;ll work alongside a talented group of video producers, motion designers, photographers, and audio specialists, contributing your expertise to a wide range of exciting projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Celonis is looking for a versatile Video Producer to join our Creative Production team. We are currently scaling and are open to meeting&amp;nbsp; both Mid-Level and Senior Producers, focusing on finding the right creative spark and technical DNA to fit our evolving team.Whether you are a rising talent looking to own end-to-end productions in a fast-paced B2B tech environment, or a seasoned strategist capable of leading complex global campaigns and vendor relations, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Video Producer at Celonis, you will be the bridge between complex B2B software solutions and engaging visual storytelling. You will manage the full production lifecycle—from concept and collaborate with our content writing team to on-set direction and post-production oversight. You’ll collaborate with Marketing, Product, and Sales teams to ensure our brand narrative is consistent, high-quality, and impactful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;End-to-End Production: Manage conceptualization, storyboarding, collaborate with scriptwriting, and delivery for marketing campaigns, product demos, and social content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Production Oversight: Lead on-set and remote shoots, directing talent and managing technical crews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Post-Production Management: Oversee editing, color grading, motion design and sound design, ensuring technical excellence and brand alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner with Marketing and Product teams to translate technical software features into human-centric stories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Project Management: Maintain production schedules, track budgets, and ensure high-quality delivery within marketing timelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Team Interface: Serve as the primary point of contact for internal and external stakeholders, cross-functional teams, and production partners, ensuring clear communication and alignment throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Complexity &amp;amp; Autonomy: Lead high-budget, multi-stakeholder projects with minimal oversight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Education: Bachelor’s degree in Film, Media, Marketing, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Portfolio: A strong portfolio demonstrating diverse video projects (B2B or Tech experience is a major plus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Technical Proficiency: Deep knowledge of Adobe Creative Cloud (Premiere Pro) and modern production workflows (lighting, sound, cinematography).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;B2B Curiosity: A genuine interest in diving deep into software products to explain &quot;the how and the why&quot; of complex technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience Levels: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Senior Producer: 4–6 years of experience in a production environment (In house corporate / agency )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
