&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Solutions Architect&lt;/strong&gt; specializing in containerized solutions, you will play a crucial, pioneering role in this new initiative. Your primary focus will be leading the deployment of these self-hosted solutions within our complex enterprise customer environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Given the unique nature of every customer environment, you will be the key liaison for translating the customer&#39;s technical requirements to ensure successful deployment on the client&#39;s infrastructure and successful integrations with their source systems. Furthermore, you will lead discussions on user management and authentication, acting as a technical partner to remove any technical barriers to user adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the &lt;strong&gt;central technical stakeholder&lt;/strong&gt; for successful delivery and onboarding of the Celonis platform for our enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deployment Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex technical discussions to analyze customer architecture, recommend optimal containerized solutions, and facilitate deployment, expertly managing expectations amidst technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Federal Deployment &amp;amp; Security Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the deployment of containerized applications in environments of certain federal accounts, and work with our compliance and security engineering teams to actively maintain&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POA&amp;amp;Ms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support documentation efforts capturing new integration and deployment scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish data integrations between customer systems and Celonis using our built-in extractors, APIs, and python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively remove technical obstacles to maximize Celonis user adoption, clarifying technical risks and necessary trade-offs for stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide customers on authentication (SSO), user/group management (LDAP), and provisioning best practices, removing technical barriers to adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Promote reusability by discerning between dedicated customer solutions and broader platform enhancements, collaborating directly with Celonis Product Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of 5+ years deploying and managing containerized applications on Kubernetes.&amp;nbsp; Advanced knowledge with at least one specific Kubernetes distribution (Amazon EKS, Azure AKS, RedHat OpenShift, etc).&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The candidate should bring a good understanding of best practices in deploying, scaling, and maintaining highly available, secure and resilient containerized applications on Kubernetes, ensuring efficient resource utilization and operational stability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role requires an active Government Clearance (Public Trust, Secret or Top Secret, with 18 months-2 years of remaining eligibility).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience implementing infrastructure as code (IaC, e.g. with Terraform) is required; Helm or Kustomize experience is strongly preferred. Fluency with additional tools such as ArgoCD, Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Ansible, etc, is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one of the major cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) would be a plus as well as their CLI’s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &amp;amp; interest in working with modern tech stack &amp;amp; methods like REST/SOAP API-Management, Data Ingestion &amp;amp; Streaming (Kafka or similar), SSO, LDAP, IT Security, Agile, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in industry with experience to work on Python, SQL, data pipelines &amp;amp; ETL processes for large volumes of data is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable about security and compliance topics for enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with project management, outstanding customer-centric &amp;amp; proven experience working with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented professional that enjoys deep technical discussions as much as transferring your technical knowledge into understandable terms to a broader audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with standard AI tools to expedite and enhance quality of day to day tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and comfortable in executive customer situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with standard developer tools (Github, observability tools, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
