&lt;p&gt;You will be part of the Instructor-led Training Team, responsible for direct engagement with external stakeholders. This includes developing enablement journeys and delivering training. Our instructors are subject matter experts with practical experience in Celonis Process Mining across various industries and use cases. They create and deliver course content, answer questions, and provide support to learners through lectures, demonstrations, hands-on exercises, and group discussions. Our team is global and collaborative.&lt;/p&gt;
