&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and lead live enablement workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver customized enablement journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with partners and customers on using the Celonis Platform to generate value for their organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative enablement approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with key accounts to understand their enablement needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
