&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Value Engineer, you will support AI and data-driven business transformation within the Public sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Senior and Lead VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to support complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
