&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2+ years of relevant working experience with foundational knowledge in consulting, value engineering, or enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Foundational background in enterprise IT, SaaS, or business software (e.g., SAP). You are an AI-fluent operator, highly proficient at using AI tools to generate technical outputs, partnering with technical teams for deep solutioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working with ambiguity. Driven by a mandate to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, you proactively seek out coming up with novel, innovative solution designs for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of process improvement methodologies and a strong desire to become a value realization expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing project milestones and delivering clear presentations to internal and external stakeholders. Flawless English Dutch communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Foundational understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and Public Sector domains. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics, comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor.&lt;/li&gt;
